  "description": "TIBSEG crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C39 H91 O14 Tm5. From the CIF bond table, Tm1 (Tm) has 6 O neighbors; Tm2 (Tm) has 6 O neighbors; Tm3 (Tm) has 6 O neighbors; Tm4 (Tm) has 6 O neighbors; Tm5 (Tm) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 10 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.264-4.645 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 85.75-172.29°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Tm5O(OiPr)13] (C39H91O14Tm5). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 13 OiPr (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
